Package: geodensity
Title: Geodesic Kernel Density Estimation for Spatial Data
Version: 0.2.0
Maintainer: Andrew Gene Brown <brown.andrewg@gmail.com>
Authors@R: person(
    given = c("Andrew", "Gene"),
    family = "Brown",
